WEBVTT


00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:11.333
<b> Translated by Agestone</ b>


00:00:34.042 --> 00:00:37.375
<i>The collapse night
January 15, 1905 -</i>


00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:41.458
<i>- överrumplade people
as they slept deepest.</i>


00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:47.208
<i>It was in Lodalen in Nordfjord
like a great mountain collapsed.</i>


00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:51.750
<i>The result was a large wave
which killed 63 people.</i>


00:00:52.792 --> 00:00:58.250
<i>The wave coursing through Lovatnet
and struck the country, 40 meters high.</i>


00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:03.667
<i>It is 58 years since Tafjord disaster
in Sunnmøre.</i>


00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:08.958
<i>40 people lost their lives when
a big rock fell into the lake.</i>


00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:18.792
<i>The figures show that there are now
300 unstable mountain in Norway.</i>


00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:24.000
<i>Everyone knows that it is a matter of time
before the next major landslides occur.</i>


00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:30.417
<i>Geiranger threatened by fears
will be a new Tafjordkatastrof disaster.</i>


00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:33.625
<i>At the fjord hanging Åkerneset.</i>


00:01:33.792 --> 00:01:38.292
<i>A giant unstable
massifs that will crumble.</i>


00:01:38.458 --> 00:01:42.833
<i>Then rages 7 million cubic meters of stone
right down to the fjord -</i>


00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.000
<i>And creates a huge tidal wave.</i>


00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:51.542
<i>Nowhere else have you seen
so active cracks in Åkerneset.</i>


00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:56.833
<i>The question is: Can people be warned
before the mountain collapses into the fjord?</i>


00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:11.208
VÅGEN


00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:16.125
What's this?
I'm 40! Come on!


00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:39.542
- Hello?
- Hi dad.


00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:44.375
What's going on?
Mom fix the sink.


00:04:44.542 --> 00:04:46.833
Can you give me a pair of pliers?


00:04:49.208 --> 00:04:53.000
We can not call a plumber? Here.


00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:57.875
I do not need a plumber,
but can I get a wrench?


00:04:59.583 --> 00:05:03.458
- It is located in the...
- Here, Mom.


00:05:03.625 --> 00:05:07.958
- How Do you know how the wrench looks like?
- I know that.


00:05:11.458 --> 00:05:13.292
So there.


00:05:16.083 --> 00:05:18.958
There we avoid till when we move.


00:05:21.417 --> 00:05:23.667
This house has soul.


00:05:24.917 --> 00:05:26.489
What is the "soul"?


00:05:26.516 --> 00:05:30.568
Soul is like that nonsense
mother believes in.


00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:33.720
- What did you say?
- I did not say anything.


00:05:33.747 --> 00:05:42.125
The apartment is brand new. It has beautiful
views, outside the door is the whole town.


00:05:42.292 --> 00:05:45.167
And everything is
controlled by remote control.


00:05:45.333 --> 00:05:49.250
- Lamps, music, blinds...
- Pass down the Broccoli.


00:05:49.417 --> 00:05:53.708
And that I liked most.


00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:57.917
That one can unlock and open the door
with the mobile.


00:06:00.292 --> 00:06:02.958
It has Lock app.


00:06:05.042 --> 00:06:10.250
It's that what you trust?
No, I did double check.


00:06:10.417 --> 00:06:15.708
I have never seen a Lock app
before in my life. Come on!


00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:26.458
Idun, what do you think?
Should these be thrown? Or...?


00:06:27.917 --> 00:06:31.667
Toss your shirts?
Are they not nice?


00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:34.750
New place, new industry...


00:06:36.292 --> 00:06:38.833
Okay. You know what?


00:06:40.792 --> 00:06:45.458
I think you have to wear a suit.
Suit and tie, from now on.


00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:51.167
Get a haircut, get stylish hairstyle.
This will be great.


00:06:51.333 --> 00:06:55.958
We do not care about it and stay here.
No, now we have decided.


00:06:56.125 --> 00:06:58.375
It will be fine.


00:06:59.542 --> 00:07:03.625
Maybe I can get
more attention than the mountain.


00:07:03.792 --> 00:07:06.542
Want attention?


00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:10.083
Shall I give you attention?
Dont tickle me!


00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:18.958
No! Not on the kitchen counter!


00:07:20.125 --> 00:07:22.917
We'll cook there in the morning.


00:07:34.333 --> 00:07:39.542
Åknes / Geiranger exceeded monitoring
102.1 meters above sea level


00:07:59.417 --> 00:08:02.000
The sixth to the seventh.


00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.125
Is everything normal?


00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:16.292
0.3 mm in the last day.
It is well within the limit.


00:08:16.458 --> 00:08:20.500
Hi.
How was it with the old oil town?


00:08:21.792 --> 00:08:25.375
As usual. Bunch of suits.


00:08:25.542 --> 00:08:29.917
- Capitalists Classic dress.
- How long has it been?


00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.458
Two days in the big city
and he's connoisseurs.


00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:37.208
Yes, you can.


00:08:40.625 --> 00:08:44.292
"Thank you for everything"...
It sounds like you're buried.


00:08:44.458 --> 00:08:47.750
Make the cake yourself next time then.


00:08:47.917 --> 00:08:52.792
- There I hope will be long.
- It Looks absolutely stunning, Margot.


00:08:52.958 --> 00:08:55.042
Yes...


00:08:56.542 --> 00:09:02.125
My dear Kristian, Remember that this is..
your last day with us.


00:09:02.292 --> 00:09:05.083
<i>It sounds like funeral...</i>


00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:07.042
Here, Jacob.


00:09:07.208 --> 00:09:11.583
Now, unfortunately, this is not the case
We only have mountains here.


00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.167
There are mountains in the North Sea as well.


00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:18.208
I understand the oil guys
who want you


00:09:18.375 --> 00:09:21.917
You are talented and dedicated.


00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:26.958
I speak for everyone here when I say
you will be missed very much.


00:09:27.125 --> 00:09:30.250
- It gets boring.
- Thanks.


00:09:30.917 --> 00:09:36.958
But it will be a fantastic feeling
not triple-checking everything we do.


00:09:39.333 --> 00:09:42.917
- Toast for that.
- Toast.


00:10:26.417 --> 00:10:30.292
- Is this The fifth level, too?
- It looks that way.


00:10:30.458 --> 00:10:33.625
- What happend?
- Grundvattnet Suddenly dropped.


00:10:33.792 --> 00:10:38.167
In the fourth, and fifth level.
And then we lost contact.


00:10:38.333 --> 00:10:40.083
Can you show me?


00:10:46.375 --> 00:10:49.750
- Go to camera A.
- Two Seconds.


00:10:53.917 --> 00:10:56.167
Zoom in?


00:10:57.875 --> 00:11:02.333
- There Were no other movements?
- No. Completely still.


00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:07.042
- The Connection may be poor.
- It Appears stable.


00:11:07.208 --> 00:11:11.833
We take a look next time we're up there.
Somebody turn off the alarm damn?!


00:11:13.125 --> 00:11:16.083
Kristian? Kristian!


00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:22.250
The mountain is still. It is okay.
Stick and pack. We have controlled..


00:11:31.167 --> 00:11:34.875
- Look, I got room for everything!
- Great, Honey.


00:11:36.292 --> 00:11:40.458
Shall I take these too?
Yes, you can carry that too.


00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:46.208
- Is he going to help?
- Well, He should in fact help.


00:11:48.208 --> 00:11:52.958
- Hello. How is the packing?
- It's fine.


00:11:56.708 --> 00:12:01.750
That frown, Kristian...
I thought it would go away now.


00:12:05.042 --> 00:12:08.958
Something strange happend
With the ground water in the day.


00:12:09.125 --> 00:12:12.208
It is not your job anymore.


00:12:12.375 --> 00:12:15.708
That rock has stood for thousands of years
and will stand securely for thousands more.


00:12:17.042 --> 00:12:21.500
Now you can finish packing completely
So that we can drive out tomorrow.


00:12:22.917 --> 00:12:26.667
Pack away that frown too.
So, let's go now!


00:12:28.792 --> 00:12:31.792
You can see how the
mother run with the Father?


00:12:31.818 --> 00:12:34.317
Everyone needs help,
you know, dad.


00:13:26.792 --> 00:13:29.333
How are you, buddy?


00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:35.333
I like it here.


00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:39.708
I know that Geiranger is not the
center of the world, but...


00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.375
It's safe. It's home.


00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:51.458
I know it's hard.
It's not that.


00:13:54.125 --> 00:13:59.125
But mom and I took a decision
which we believe is best for our family.


00:14:01.125 --> 00:14:05.542
It is not always easy to be the one
who must make the tough decisions.


00:14:05.708 --> 00:14:08.750
But what will be the next?


00:14:08.917 --> 00:14:12.125
When we lived in Stavanger for two years.


00:14:12.292 --> 00:14:15.833
It will be up and out
and we will moving again?


00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.667
The whole damn country's stone.


00:14:39.667 --> 00:14:42.625
Whats happening here? Are you going to move?


00:14:43.833 --> 00:14:45.833
Come here.


00:14:48.292 --> 00:14:51.208
- You also.
- Me too.


00:14:51.917 --> 00:14:54.125
Hey, Sondre.


00:14:54.292 --> 00:14:57.917
We'll see how long you stand out
with just asphalt and...


00:14:58.083 --> 00:15:02.750
And Kristian with a tie around his neck.
It will be something completely new.


00:15:04.042 --> 00:15:07.917
- We get used to it.
- It Tightens around his neck.


00:15:08.083 --> 00:15:11.958
- Are you ready?
- Yes, basically.


00:15:12.125 --> 00:15:16.708
The my family will take the ferry today
and I work a couple of days more.


00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:20.958
- So You are not going now?
- -No, you're not getting rid of me yet.


00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:59.000
- Dad, it's our turn.
- Are you going to go or what?


00:17:15.375 --> 00:17:18.417
Wait here. I will not take long.


00:17:22.167 --> 00:17:27.625
- I bought the apartment and stuff.
- Hey. I have to show you something.


00:17:47.625 --> 00:17:52.167
Hotel Geiranger
1.7 meters above sea level


00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.250
- Hey, Vibeke.
- Finally your here.


00:18:03.417 --> 00:18:05.917
I was going to help you.


00:18:06.083 --> 00:18:09.792
Welcome to Geiranger.
Sorry you about the wait.


00:18:09.958 --> 00:18:12.875
- It doesn't matter.
- What's your name?


00:18:13.042 --> 00:18:17.083
- Maria And Phillip Poulsen.
- We'll see if we have a room.


00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:20.292
- Is your family gone
- They will be soon, to the ferry.


00:18:21.708 --> 00:18:27.208
What if there is a problem with
sensors, but with the lines there.


00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.667
Don't believe me?


00:18:32.583 --> 00:18:37.042
All mountain consists of plates.
Our mountain is no exception.


00:18:37.208 --> 00:18:40.583
Our drilling goes through all the plates.


00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:45.583
You said groundwater disappeared
just before we lost contact.


00:18:47.125 --> 00:18:50.792
Groundwater
do not disappear just like that.


00:18:50.958 --> 00:18:55.375
It finds new ways, make new layer.
It creates friction.


00:18:55.542 --> 00:18:59.167
And it means that the layers are displaced.


00:18:59.333 --> 00:19:04.083
If the offsets were large enough
it may have cut lines.


00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:09.417
When we drill new holes and replace
sensors. It's no big deal.


00:19:09.583 --> 00:19:11.250
No.


00:19:11.417 --> 00:19:16.750
But if the load of the mountain
shifts were big enough...


00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:25.958
There will be no enlargement before the fall.


00:19:29.375 --> 00:19:32.625
And there will be no warnings.


00:21:23.708 --> 00:21:29.375
Checkpoint Ørnereidet
874.1 meters above sea level


00:21:32.125 --> 00:21:34.208
Gently now.


00:21:34.375 --> 00:21:38.375
That's Geir Angers
main tourist attractions.


00:21:46.875 --> 00:21:51.458
When you are in such a beautiful place
then you want to see the fjord.


00:21:51.625 --> 00:21:56.250
I understand that. Just tell me if
you need something. Bye for now!


00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:04.375
Hey, Sondre. What?


00:22:08.333 --> 00:22:10.042
Where are you now?


00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.625
Okay?


00:23:01.875 --> 00:23:03.667
Shit!


00:23:20.458 --> 00:23:22.583
We have contact?


00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.917
<i>- Do you have a picture?
- Yes, we are watching you.</i>


00:23:27.167 --> 00:23:29.917
It is good to know.


00:23:50.833 --> 00:23:54.583
You check the fourth level,
and I'll take the five.


00:24:38.625 --> 00:24:40.542
Kristian?


00:25:05.958 --> 00:25:11.333
- This is not the natural wear.
- No, it's clear that something happend.


00:25:11.500 --> 00:25:15.458
There is quite a lot of movement
in the mountain now. You get it?


00:25:15.625 --> 00:25:19.792
We should of course look into it further.
We solve it.


00:25:19.958 --> 00:25:21.750
What do you mean?


00:25:21.917 --> 00:25:25.125
More tests, drill more holes.


00:25:25.292 --> 00:25:31.083
More holes? Are you crazy? Do I have to
remind you of what can happen?


00:25:33.958 --> 00:25:37.292
We're talking about a
80-meter high wave here.


00:25:37.458 --> 00:25:40.667
After ten minutes
is not Geiranger.


00:25:40.875 --> 00:25:44.958
- We also know what can happen.
- It doesn't seem so.


00:25:45.167 --> 00:25:48.542
What the hell do you want me to do?


00:25:51.958 --> 00:25:55.833
Should I press this
and create complete panic?


00:25:56.000 --> 00:25:59.000
Call off the tourist season in the linda?


00:25:59.167 --> 00:26:03.750
- When do you care about tourism?
- That's not what this is about.


00:26:03.958 --> 00:26:05.667
What happens-


00:26:05.833 --> 00:26:10.167
If we cry wolf every time we think
that something happens up there?


00:26:10.333 --> 00:26:13.917
What the hell do we do the day
after a collapse yesterday?


00:26:14.083 --> 00:26:16.500
Tell us what we should do then.


00:26:20.833 --> 00:26:25.708
Yellow alert. Full staffing,
24-on-call on top of the mountain


00:26:25.875 --> 00:26:27.750
Yes.


00:26:29.292 --> 00:26:31.250
What do you think?


00:26:33.708 --> 00:26:36.292
Are you going to just stand
by and watch it happen?!


00:26:39.792 --> 00:26:41.958
Jacob?


00:26:48.375 --> 00:26:52.542
Kristian, listen.
I understand that you are upset.


00:26:52.708 --> 00:26:57.458
I know you just want the best,
but you need to calm down.


00:27:01.583 --> 00:27:06.667
We found the severed wires. Nothing
suggests that something should be done.


00:27:07.833 --> 00:27:10.875
The mountain is still, Christian.


00:27:12.292 --> 00:27:15.458
Okay. sorry.


00:27:17.417 --> 00:27:20.458
I do not know what came over me.


00:27:21.583 --> 00:27:24.000
I will not...


00:27:43.667 --> 00:27:45.875
We are not waiting here. Call mother.


00:27:46.458 --> 00:27:49.500
Oh, shit! Gosh!


00:27:57.292 --> 00:28:02.292
Geez... You are so fucking smoked.


00:28:20.458 --> 00:28:22.417
You have a visitor.


00:28:34.500 --> 00:28:37.083
Have you gone mad?


00:28:37.292 --> 00:28:41.208
You can not put the kids in the car
and then work for several hours.


00:28:41.375 --> 00:28:45.917
- I know. I'm sorry.
- You don't even work there anymore.


00:28:46.083 --> 00:28:49.333
- I fucked up.
- Yes, You did.


00:28:49.500 --> 00:28:52.667
I got a bad feeling and so...


00:28:54.125 --> 00:28:57.833
Yes. There will be no Stavanger today.


00:29:00.458 --> 00:29:03.083
- No.
- Okay.


00:29:03.250 --> 00:29:06.958
You guys get to sleep at
the hotel for the night.


00:29:07.125 --> 00:29:09.875
- Kanon.
- We will? Okay?


00:29:10.708 --> 00:29:13.667
- -So you get to try again tomorrow.
- Yes.


00:29:13.875 --> 00:29:18.375
- But I want to sleep at home.
- It's completely empty and not cozy.


00:29:20.333 --> 00:29:26.083
- I want to say goodbye to the house.
- Do You want to?, we'll go. Come on.


00:29:29.042 --> 00:29:32.542
- Is that OK?
- Then it becomes the house.


00:29:35.208 --> 00:29:37.417
- Are you coming?
- No.


00:29:37.583 --> 00:29:41.458
- I'll fix a hotel room for you.
- Yes thank you.


00:29:41.625 --> 00:29:46.458
Say goodbye from me too.
So. Good night my Dear.


00:29:48.000 --> 00:29:51.208
Bye.
See you tomorrow.


00:29:54.875 --> 00:29:58.458
- Okay. Then we go and pack.
- Can I take your name please?


00:29:58.667 --> 00:30:01.500
My name is Sondre Eikjord.


00:30:05.208 --> 00:30:08.417
- Can I sit in the front?
- yes you can.


00:30:19.042 --> 00:30:22.875
Okay, put your belt on
And tighten it.


00:30:24.375 --> 00:30:26.833
Okay, then we are done.


00:30:30.250 --> 00:30:32.208
- Dad.
- Yes?


00:30:32.375 --> 00:30:38.375
- Are You and Mom divorce now?
- -No. No, we would not be separated now.


00:30:40.042 --> 00:30:43.917
We argued a little.
and then we become friends again.


00:30:44.083 --> 00:30:47.542
And everything is fine again.


00:30:47.750 --> 00:30:49.625
I hope.


00:30:49.833 --> 00:30:53.625
- That's life.
- That's life!


00:30:54.875 --> 00:30:57.375
Here's your room.


00:30:59.208 --> 00:31:01.083
So.


00:31:02.917 --> 00:31:06.500
I hope this room
meets your expectations.


00:31:11.083 --> 00:31:14.042
- Have it so cozy.
- It is.


00:31:14.208 --> 00:31:19.000
Can I go and work? You know what
bottles you must not take from the mini bar?


00:31:19.167 --> 00:31:21.208
Well then.


00:31:21.375 --> 00:31:24.667
And which TV channels you shouldn't see?


00:31:27.125 --> 00:31:28.625
Watch out.


00:31:30.750 --> 00:31:33.333
Where do we sleep, Dad?


00:31:42.083 --> 00:31:44.292
I'll sleep in this.


00:31:44.458 --> 00:31:46.917
I sleep well in it.


00:31:54.833 --> 00:31:58.667
So. Does that feel good?


00:31:58.833 --> 00:32:01.667
We don't need a hotel.


00:32:03.875 --> 00:32:08.500
- No, this is has more soul.
- Yes...


00:32:11.208 --> 00:32:13.792
Yes, it actually has it.


00:32:54.583 --> 00:32:58.792
Dear Christian. Thanks for the great years.
Good luck in Stavanger.


00:33:43.625 --> 00:33:46.083
TSUNAMI DANGER ZONE


00:33:54.125 --> 00:33:56.333
SHELTER


00:34:03.833 --> 00:34:06.333
I behaved like an idiot today.
I'm sorry.


00:34:38.000 --> 00:34:41.792
- What Shit beds this is.
- Yes


00:34:44.833 --> 00:34:49.583
sad that it would end like that.
with Kristian.


00:34:51.625 --> 00:34:54.958
Do you think he will stay
long in the oil industry?


00:34:56.750 --> 00:35:00.083
We'll see.
He will probably be back in a year.


00:35:05.042 --> 00:35:08.625
When the mountains got hold of you
they never release you.


00:35:10.333 --> 00:35:14.625
What the hell, Arvid?
I read it in a book.


00:35:15.833 --> 00:35:17.708
You did well.


00:36:03.083 --> 00:36:06.875
<i>The Hurtigruten crusing ship means something
for people along the coast.</i>


00:36:07.042 --> 00:36:10.083
<i>It's an incredibly beautiful ride.</i>


00:36:10.250 --> 00:36:13.708
<i>Some call it
the world's most beautiful voyage...</i>


00:36:25.750 --> 00:36:28.458
- Hello.
- Hello.


00:37:34.125 --> 00:37:36.208
<i>Hello?</i>


00:37:44.333 --> 00:37:46.500
Mikal?


00:37:57.708 --> 00:37:59.458
Damn!


00:38:05.542 --> 00:38:07.458
Shit!


00:38:11.667 --> 00:38:13.958
- Margot?
- Yes?


00:38:41.167 --> 00:38:44.917
<i>- Arvid?
- Jacob?</i>


00:38:49.458 --> 00:38:54.125
<i>Hello? Can you hear me?</i>


00:38:57.792 --> 00:39:00.917
<i>- Arvid?
- Yes, Come in.</i>


00:39:01.083 --> 00:39:05.125
We have unsual data here.


00:39:05.292 --> 00:39:08.958
It looks
as if the mountain has been pulled together.


